flowchart TD
 A[Google Sheet rows: group/task/due] --> P[Proposed plan changes]
 P --> H{Approve plan revision?}
 H -- Yes --> L[(Locked individual plans)]
 H -- No --> Z[Keep existing revision]
 M[Moodle assignments / submitted MR URLs] --> E[Evidence intake]
 G[GitLab MR, diffs, reviews] --> E
 E --> C[Generate task candidates within applicable plans]
 L --> C
 C --> D{Clear safe match?}
 D -- Yes --> K[Create evidence-task links]
 D -- Ambiguous --> R[Human review inbox]
 R --> K
 D -- Insufficient --> U[Unresolved evidence]
 K --> W{Accepted under course policy?}
 W -- Yes --> T[Accepted result]
 W -- No --> O[Submitted / review / rework status]
 T --> X[Student and group analytics]
 O --> X
